{"id":"5156102396088b66","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-parse-tree.md","title":"带产生式约束的推导树","display":"df-cfg-parse-tree — 带产生式约束的推导树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-parse-tree","aliases":["73-df-cfg-parse-tree"],"display":"df-cfg-parse-tree — 带产生式约束的推导树","depends_on":["[[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]","[[73-df-cfg-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.1–5.2, print pp. 171–194; PDF pp. 193–216; local typed grammar/tree interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§4.3, pp. 82–84; scans 90–92","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-parse-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-parse-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cfg-parse-tree — 带产生式约束的推导树"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"018ebd908b6f5c76\" href=\"?note=018ebd908b6f5c76\" title=\"73-df-ordered-tree-domain\">73-df-ordered-tree-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.1–5.2, print pp. 171–194; PDF pp. 193–216; local typed grammar/tree interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§4.3, pp. 82–84; scans 90–92"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为候选树。树地址与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_D\">\\(\\kappa_D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"018ebd908b6f5c76\" href=\"?note=018ebd908b6f5c76\" title=\"73-df-ordered-tree-domain\">73-df-ordered-tree-domain</a>；文法结构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>。推导树允许非终结符作叶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}parse\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(t,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in\\{E\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TreeDom}(E)\\}\\;\n\\exists\\ell:D\\to V\\cup\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\Bigl[&amp;t=(D,\\ell)\\land\\ell(\\varepsilon)=A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\ell(d)\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\Longrightarrow\\kappa_D(d)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in\\{e\\in D:\\kappa_D(e)&gt;0\\}\\;\\Bigl[\\ell(d)\\in V\\land\\bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\;\n[(\\ell(d),\\alpha)\\in P\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\\;\\ell(d\\langle i\\rangle)=\\alpha(i-1)]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor[(\\ell(d),\\varepsilon)\\in P\\land\\kappa_D(d)=1\\land\\ell(d\\langle1\\rangle)=\\varepsilon]\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}parse\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(t,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in\\{E\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TreeDom}(E)\\}\\;\n\\exists\\ell:D\\to V\\cup\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\Bigl[&amp;t=(D,\\ell)\\land\\ell(\\varepsilon)=A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\ell(d)\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\Longrightarrow\\kappa_D(d)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in\\{e\\in D:\\kappa_D(e)&gt;0\\}\\;\\Bigl[\\ell(d)\\in V\\land\\bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\;\n[(\\ell(d),\\alpha)\\in P\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\\;\\ell(d\\langle i\\rangle)=\\alpha(i-1)]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor[(\\ell(d),\\varepsilon)\\in P\\land\\kappa_D(d)=1\\land\\ell(d\\langle1\\rangle)=\\varepsilon]\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>内部节点的子标记按从左到右顺序组成所用产生式的右部。空产生式用唯一的 ε 叶表示。非终结符叶表示尚未展开的部分推导，因此单根树也合法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-ordered-tree-domain","status":"resolved","id":"018ebd908b6f5c76","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","em